WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:12.000
Start with the part you can observe.

00:12.000 --> 00:24.000
Follow the relationship as it changes.

00:24.000 --> 00:36.000
A model is a useful selective representation. Record assumptions and limits so readers know when results may fail.

00:36.000 --> 00:48.000
A fixed Cd drag equation omits changing yaw and flow separation; keep its conditions beside the answer.

00:48.000 --> 01:00.000
Model-limit audit

01:00.000 --> 01:12.000
A block diagram is a model, not a finished vehicle or proof of legal roadworthiness.

